WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
Thankfully, Naruto took after his parents&nbsp;
and had a caring teacher in Iruka-Sensei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.520
who was a positive role model for the&nbsp;
young shinobi. Thanks to those factors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:13.080
Naruto grew up into the person we know and&nbsp;
love - embodying the values of friendship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.460
and teamwork. It also helped that he’s the&nbsp;
reincarnation of a really nice guy. [show Asura]

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:22.080
But what if Naruto hadn’t had that&nbsp;
great influence in his life? After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.680
Iruka’s own parents were killed&nbsp;
by the Nine-Tailed Fox that lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.020
inside of Naruto - he had every reason to despise&nbsp;
Naruto just like everyone else in the village,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:36.480
leading Naruto to go down a very dark&nbsp;
path similar to Sasuke. So, how would the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:43.140
Naruto world look different if our hero became&nbsp;
a villain? What if Naruto joined the Akatsuki?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.580
Well, first off, we have a pretty good idea&nbsp;
of what happens when a kid with the power of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.100
a tailed beast is completely mal-adjusted&nbsp;
and has a horrible upbringing. Just take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:58.200
a look at Gaara. When we first meet Gaara,&nbsp;
he is contrasted with Naruto because their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:03.240
stories are so similar. Both of them are&nbsp;
Jinchuriki - the term for someone with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:08.580
tailed beast sealed inside them. Both of them&nbsp;
had lonely and painful childhoods. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:12.900
Gaara lacked a relationship like&nbsp;
Naruto had with Iruka Sensei.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:17.340
Instead, Gaara had a relationship with his&nbsp;
uncle Yashamaru. The two were very close,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.880
but Yashamaru was ordered by Gaara’s own father&nbsp;
to assassinate him. After being betrayed by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:30.780
only person he loved, Gaara fell deeper into&nbsp;
darkness, hatred, and violence. Can’t really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:36.420
blame him - I think I’d do the same if my&nbsp;
own uncle tried to assassinate me. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:42.900
there’s one major difference: Gaara was still used&nbsp;
as a pawn and weapon by the Hidden Sand Village.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:47.160
Naruto’s powers, however, were restricted&nbsp;
at all costs by the Hidden Leaf Village.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:52.680
The Nine-Tailed Beast, Kurama, was simply too&nbsp;
powerful to contain. After all, as everyone knows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:58.800
the more tails you have, the stronger you are.&nbsp;
Instead of being able to use these powers, Naruto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:04.320
tapping into the beast’s chakra risked unleashing&nbsp;
the Nine Tailed Fox to attack Konoha again.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.840
This time, when Orochimaru and the Sand Village&nbsp;
attack the Hidden Leaf during the Chunin Exams,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:15.720
things would play out extremely differently.&nbsp;
In Naruto as we know it, the Sand Village send&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.920
their greatest weapon, Gaara, to attack the&nbsp;
Hidden Leaf in order to improve their own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:24.540
economic conditions. I mean, they could have&nbsp;
just instituted a higher capital gains tax,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:29.280
but go off, I guess. Thankfully, Naruto&nbsp;
was there to go head to head with Gaara,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.520
eventually causing the fellow&nbsp;
Jinchuriki to have a change of heart.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:39.360
In this timeline, though, Naruto won’t influence&nbsp;
Gaara. It will be the other way around. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.980
Leaf Jonin such as Kakashi and Might Guy will&nbsp;
ultimately be able to stave off Gaara’s attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:49.500
even though he has the power of Shukaku on&nbsp;
his side. This is especially true if Jiraiya,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.100
one of the legendary Sannin, gets&nbsp;
involved in the fight as well. After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:56.640
the natural weakness of sand is toads…obviously.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:02.100
However, Naruto will see how powerful Gaara&nbsp;
is when he utilizes the strength of the beast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:06.480
within him. He’ll see how feared he&nbsp;
is by his own village and siblings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:11.520
He’ll see how the Sand Village will bend to&nbsp;
his will in order to avoid angering Gaara.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:17.580
Knowing that he can’t be loved by the citizens&nbsp;
of Konoha, Naruto might take another path:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:22.500
being feared. He’ll become more aggressive&nbsp;
toward his fellow classmates and villagers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:27.960
and won’t fear tapping more recklessly into&nbsp;
Kurama’s chakra to enhance his own strength.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:32.820
The only danger is Kurama convincing Naruto to&nbsp;
undo the seal and unleashing the beast - However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:36.240
I’m going to say he won’t give in&nbsp;
to Kurama’s temptation to release&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:40.140
him because Naruto will want to&nbsp;
control that power for himself.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.940
In our new timeline, instead of staying in&nbsp;
the Hidden Leaf Village as a member of Team 7,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:49.500
Naruto will be pushed away. After being&nbsp;
rejected by the citizens of the village,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.700
he’ll abandon his home and run away. In&nbsp;
an inversion of the Sasuke rescue arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:57.360
we can still see these two fated&nbsp;
rivals compete against one another.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:04.920
Instead of eyeing Sasuke for his replacement body,&nbsp;
this time Orochimaru could seek out Naruto - yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:09.780
Sasuke has the sharingan, but it’s clear&nbsp;
that Orochimaru would be interested in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:13.920
the immense powers of Kurama. So this&nbsp;
time, the Konoha shinobi would try to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:18.780
retrieve Naruto from the Sound Four leading to&nbsp;
a familiar showdown between Naruto and Sasuke.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:24.120
However, there are two differences this time.&nbsp;
Firstly, Sasuke would be missing his curse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:31.380
mark - and on top of that Naruto would be way more&nbsp;
willing to tap into Kurama’s chakra. Therefore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.440
Naruto would absolutely stomp&nbsp;
Sasuke in their battle this time.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:39.780
However, just like Sasuke, Naruto would soon&nbsp;
realize he’s being used by Orochimaru and would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:45.240
abandon his side in order to achieve his own&nbsp;
goals. It just so happens, too, that there’s an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:52.440
organization that’s specifically on the lookout&nbsp;
for Jinchuriki: The Akatsuki. And Naruto would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:57.960
already be somewhat aware of this organization,&nbsp;
too. First Orochimaru was temporarily aligned with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:03.720
the group and more importantly, he had encountered&nbsp;
Itachi and Kisame previously. Since Naruto’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:09.480
biggest rival in Konoha was Sasuke, it makes sense&nbsp;
that Naruto may join up with Itachi - after all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:14.880
the enemy of your enemy is your friend.&nbsp;
The Akatsuki would allow him to enact his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:20.400
revenge against the Hidden Leaf Village who had&nbsp;
treated him poorly throughout his childhood.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:27.240
The Akatsuki was originally formed to promote&nbsp;
peace in the shinobi world: and in a twisted way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:32.760
that’s still its ultimate goal when we meet the&nbsp;
Akatsuki in the story. It’s just that they’re&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:38.340
like…super bad at it, considering their whole&nbsp;
recruitment process is based on how evil the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:42.960
candidates are. They’re working as mercenaries&nbsp;
for various villages in order to gain wealth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:47.220
but they’re also in the business&nbsp;
of collecting Tailed Beasts. Why?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.940
Well, that’s because the Tailed Beasts&nbsp;
are the ultimate weapons in the Naruto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:55.680
world - they’re the equivalent to weapons of&nbsp;
mass destruction - unleashing a tailed beast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:01.320
on a village might as well be like launching&nbsp;
a nuclear warhead. The leader of the Akatsuki,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.800
Nagato, wants to obtain each of the&nbsp;
Tailed Beasts so that he can conquer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:09.840
all of the world’s villages and stop them from&nbsp;
engaging in wars with one another by force.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.860
In Naruto Shippuden, we see the Akatsuki&nbsp;
come into focus as the main antagonists of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:18.180
the series. They target the Jinchuriki within&nbsp;
each of the villages in order to steal their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:23.460
tailed beast chakra. For example, Deidara captures&nbsp;
Gaara, and the Akatsuki steal his tailed beast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:28.560
killing the newly crowned Kazekage. Thankfully&nbsp;
Grandma Chiyo was able to sacrifice her life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:34.140
to resurrect him, but it was a close&nbsp;
call (with a hint of Deus ex Machina).

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:39.720
However, in this timeline, Gaara likely wouldn’t&nbsp;
have gone down so easily. Since Naruto never talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.820
no jutsu’d him after the Chunin Exams, Gaara&nbsp;
would still be filled with violence and malice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:49.020
giving him more of an advantage against&nbsp;
Deidara. During their battle in the real series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:53.340
Gaara has to use up a lot of his sand and&nbsp;
chakra in order to save the village from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:58.620
one of Deidara’s massive explosions. But in this&nbsp;
timeline, he’d have no reason to care about saving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:03.720
the villagers and would be able to dedicate his&nbsp;
full strength to fighting the explosive clay user.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:08.100
But luckily, the Akatsuki would have a&nbsp;
trick up their sleeve: their new member,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:13.380
Naruto Uzumaki. The only question is: when Naruto&nbsp;
knocked on the Akatsuki’s door looking to join,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:18.420
why wouldn’t their leader, Nagato, simply take&nbsp;
his tailed beast right then and there? Well, first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:23.820
off, there is the fact that Naruto is Nagato’s&nbsp;
distant cousin and a fellow member of the Uzumaki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:29.160
clan. But we have a feeling that Nagato isn’t the&nbsp;
type to get too sentimental about family ties.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:34.140
More important is the fact that Naruto&nbsp;
harnesses the power of the Nine-Tails. Remember:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:40.020
the more tails a beast has, the more powerful&nbsp;
it is, which means Naruto has more chakra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:45.480
potential than any of the other Jinchuriki. If&nbsp;
Naruto was willing to join the organization,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:50.700
he’s practically tailor made for hunting down&nbsp;
the remaining Jinchuriki. The only question is:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:55.800
would Naruto realize the natural end point,&nbsp;
which was that after the rest of the Tailed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:00.120
Beasts were captured, they would simply&nbsp;
do the same to him? Well, as we all know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.920
Naruto is…not the smartest. Though, there’s&nbsp;
also an argument to be made that if he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.700
working with the Akatsuki anyway, they&nbsp;
could still use his beast as a weapon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:14.880
of mass destruction without having to strip it&nbsp;
from Naruto. Nagato’s plan could still work. Of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:22.260
course, we have to consider Tobi’s plan,&nbsp;
too…but we’ll save that for a bit later.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:27.000
Therefore, where Deidara would likely&nbsp;
fail against a still evil Gaara, Naruto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.780
would succeed. The only question is: would&nbsp;
they still strip Gaara of his tailed beast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:35.460
or would the organization recruit Gaara as&nbsp;
well in this timeline. Just like Naruto,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:39.900
Gaara would want revenge against his village&nbsp;
and would thrive in an organization like the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:44.940
Akatsuki that would allow him to channel his&nbsp;
violent impulses into mercenary missions.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:49.980
With Gaara and Naruto as the newest team&nbsp;
of the Akatsuki, taking out the remaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:54.780
Jinchuriki would be a piece of cake.&nbsp;
Most of them were easily obtained by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.780 --> 00:09:00.300
the Akatsuki as they existed - therefore, with&nbsp;
the strength of two Jinchuriki on their side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:04.620
they’d have no problem collecting all of&nbsp;
the tailed beasts. Well…all of the tailed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:09.420
beasts except one, that is: what they&nbsp;
wouldn’t have considered is Killer B.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.480
Killer B, the right-hand man to the Raikage, is&nbsp;
known as a Perfect Jinchuriki. Instead of being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:20.820
at odds with the power inside of him, he has an&nbsp;
actual relationship with the Eight-Tailed Beast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:26.460
Gyuki. Instead of vying for power and control&nbsp;
with the monster, the two can work in sync to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:31.620
become even stronger. He can even undergo&nbsp;
a massive tailed-beast transformation. It’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:35.220
unknown whether the tailed-beast chakra&nbsp;
has any effect on his rap skills, though.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:40.680
Even with such great control of Gyuki,&nbsp;
though, it’s unlikely that he could contend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:45.420
with the all of the members of this Akatsuki&nbsp;
- Even without complete control of Kurama,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:49.860
Naruto’s chakra is overwhelming and he’d&nbsp;
have back up from the likes of Gaara,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:53.400
Itachi, Pain, and other absolute power houses.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:57.900
So, with Naruto as an Akatsuki member, this&nbsp;
criminal organization would achieve their goal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:03.540
of capturing every tailed beast. However, Nagato&nbsp;
didn’t account for a traitor in his midst. Tobi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:07.320
AKA Obito Uchiha as well as Black&nbsp;
Zetsu have been manipulating things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:12.240
behind the scenes for ages, even&nbsp;
before the Akatsuki were formed.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:16.560
While Nagato may have been content with Gaara&nbsp;
and Naruto utilizing their tailed beasts as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:21.780
Jinchuriki, this wouldn’t work for Tobi’s&nbsp;
plan. His goal was to reunite all of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:27.300
Nine Tailed Beasts into their original&nbsp;
form: the immensely powerful Ten-Tails.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:31.500
Though it would be a true battle, Tobi and the&nbsp;
Zetsus would likely be able to use deception&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:37.020
to catch Gaara or Naruto individually and&nbsp;
off guard in order to capture their beasts.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.720
With these, Tobi would be&nbsp;
able to resurrect Madara,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:44.100
but in turn Kaguya Otsutsuki would also be&nbsp;
summoned. Whereas in the original series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:49.620
Naruto and Sasuke were able to combine their&nbsp;
powers in order to barely overcome this threat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:54.420
to the planet Sasuke would be the last line of&nbsp;
defense against the Infinite Tsukuyomi and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.500
harvesting of all humans into a chakra&nbsp;
fruit for the Otsutsuki’s enjoyment.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:03.300
So what if Naruto joined the Akatsuki?&nbsp;
Well - it wouldn’t be good: in fact, Naruto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:07.980
joining the Akatsuki would spell the destruction&nbsp;
of the entire shinobi world. Remember to thank a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.880
teacher today, because without Iruka-Sensei&nbsp;
it would have been the end of the world!

